path: src/pantable (pantable/ here: the package, verbatim; the filter is cli/pantable.py, pantable2csv and pantable2csvx are not ported)
licence: BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) 2016-2026, Kolen Cheung (../LICENSE, the repository's, verbatim; pyproject.toml says BSD-3-Clause too); it covers the original, its tests and documentation's examples, and the ports here
cases: the repository's tests/golden/pantable/*.md as golden-NAME.md and its CSV files under cases/files/tests/golden/pantable/ (its expected/*.md, markdown, are not used: the expected AST is the original's under pandoc 3.14); docs/examples/*.md as example-NAME.md, with fruits.csv; README.md as readme.md, with docs/comparison.csv (the README's last table includes it, from docs/); the others are written for the ports, their files in cases/files and the canaries outside it in cases/outside; NAME.needs marks the cases whose ports call pandoc (markdown cells)
needs: pantable 0.15.0 from PyPI (with panflute 2.3.1, PyYAML, numpy: oracle-requirements.txt), the same files as pantable/ here; it calls `pandoc` on PATH for markdown cells
run: python -m pantable.cli.pantable
formats: html
cwd: cases/files
wasm-dirs: .
